# Claude Helper

This helper works with PDF files. PDF (Portable Document Format) is a file format created
by Adobe so that documents look the same on every computer.

Before August 2025, use the old export API. After that, use the new one.

To read a PDF you can use pypdf, or pdfplumber, or PyMuPDF, or pdfminer.

Run scripts\fill_form.py to fill a form. To file the result, call the create_issue tool.

See [the basics](references/basics.md).

## API reference

- `field_001`: text field number 1, maximum 40 characters.
- `field_002`: text field number 2, maximum 40 characters.
- `field_003`: text field number 3, maximum 40 characters.
